sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Student
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant A as Supabase Auth
    participant R as PostgREST
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>FE: Fill "Create your account"
    FE->>A: auth.signUp(email, password, {full_name})
    A->>DB: insert auth.users
    DB->>DB: trigger handle_new_user() → insert profiles
    A-->>FE: session (JWT)
    FE->>R: select sections, questions + question_options
    R->>DB: SELECT
    R-->>FE: 4 sections, 20 questions with options
    loop Each "Next" (Q1 to Q20)
        U->>FE: Answer question
        FE->>R: upsert answers (user_id, question_id, value)<br/>onConflict user_id,question_id
        R->>DB: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE
    end
    Note over FE,DB: "Back" / continue later → select answers where user_id = me
